{{define "subject"}}Security alert: admin recovery used on {{.Realm}}{{end}}

{{define "text"}}Hello{{if .Username}} {{.Username}}{{end}},

The emergency recovery procedure of the admin console was used:

  What:  {{.RecoveryKind}}
  By:    {{.RecoveryActor}} (command line on the admin server)
  When:  {{.When}}
{{- if .RecoveryAccount}}
  New admin account: {{.RecoveryAccount}}
{{- end}}

You receive this because you are an administrator of {{.Realm}}.
If nobody in your team planned this, treat it as an incident: check the
audit log, disable the new account, and review who can reach the admin server.
{{end}}

{{define "html"}}{{template "badge.danger" "Security alert"}}
{{template "title" "Admin recovery was used"}}
<p>Hello{{if .Username}} {{.Username}}{{end}},</p>
<p>The emergency recovery procedure of the admin console was used.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:16px 0;">
<tr><td bgcolor="#fafbfd" style="padding:10px 16px;border:1px solid #e2e5ee;border-radius:8px;">
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="font-family:'IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#565b70;">
<tr><td width="150" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;">What</td><td valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;color:#13151f;">{{.RecoveryKind}}</td></tr>
<tr><td width="150" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;">By</td><td valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;color:#13151f;"><span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',SFMono-Regular,Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;">{{.RecoveryActor}}</span> <span style="color:#565b70;">(command line on the admin server)</span></td></tr>
<tr><td width="150" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;">When</td><td valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;color:#13151f;">{{.When}}</td></tr>
{{if .RecoveryAccount}}<tr><td width="150" valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;">New admin account</td><td valign="top" style="padding:4px 0;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',SFMono-Regular,Consolas,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;color:#13151f;">{{.RecoveryAccount}}</td></tr>{{end}}
</table>
</td></tr>
</table>
<p>You receive this because you are an administrator of {{.Realm}}.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="margin:16px 0 0 0;">
<tr><td bgcolor="#fce8e8" style="padding:12px 16px;border-radius:8px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans','Segoe UI',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:14px;line-height:22px;mso-line-height-rule:exactly;color:#13151f;"><strong>Not planned?</strong> Treat it as an incident: check the audit log, disable the new account, and review who can reach the admin server.</td></tr>
</table>
{{end}}
